// diagnostics.proto — DashCenter northbound fleet-diagnostics API.
//
// This service complements ObservabilityService with COMPUTED diagnostic
// primitives: trace-flow, explain-match, ACL hit stats, drift explanation,
// and triggered flow re-simulation. These RPCs are typically interactive
// (operator-driven) rather than continuous.
//
// Cost model
// ----------
// Diagnostic RPCs may fan out to multiple DPUs and aggregate results in dashd
// before responding. Trace-flow and explain-match are bounded per RPC (single
// flow, single packet, single decision); GetAclHitStats can return large
// streams and is paginated.
//
// Determinism
// -----------
// TraceFlow and ExplainMatch operate on the CURRENT installed policy on the
// targeted DPU(s). If the policy is mid-update (a Stage exists in
// `pending:<txn_id>`), the diagnostic uses the COMMITTED view, not the staged
// view. To diagnose a staged policy, run SimulateApply on ControlPlane first.

